  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "不喝就是看不起我，领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊。这一高兴就多贪了几杯。我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。领导，您看鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根，心腹是没有刺的鱼这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪儿敢啊？我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这就剩半杯了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜呀。这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密。呵呵呵这个哈哈哈啊啊，怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了，就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。哈哈哈哈哈哈小图啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢，各高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？哈哈哈哈哈小图啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度望尘莫及，只能在e聘上找些自我安慰了。哈哈哈哈，来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能坐的，能赶上已经是我的运气了。哈哈哈，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。小图今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教，不是来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。小图啊，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，我先敬您。小图最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯小图啊，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝那些会说话会来事的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至闲惧社交，推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我一解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 2050,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2650,
      "end_ms": 3130,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3410,
      "end_ms": 4550,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4990,
      "end_ms": 6895,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9910,
      "end_ms": 11250,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11470,
      "end_ms": 11910,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12030,
      "end_ms": 13110,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13130,
      "end_ms": 14370,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14630,
      "end_ms": 16010,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16010,
      "end_ms": 16570,
      "text": "高兴啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16730,
      "end_ms": 18310,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19970,
      "end_ms": 21310,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21590,
      "end_ms": 23750,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23750,
      "end_ms": 26210,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29030,
      "end_ms": 29930,
      "text": "鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30250,
      "end_ms": 31550,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00017",
      "start_ms": 31810,
      "end_ms": 32090,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32090,
      "end_ms": 33930,
      "text": "您看鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00019",
      "start_ms": 33950,
      "end_ms": 35310,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00020",
      "start_ms": 35490,
      "end_ms": 39900,
      "text": "心腹是没有刺的鱼这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39900,
      "end_ms": 40600,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40840,
      "end_ms": 41260,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41260,
      "end_ms": 42060,
      "text": "我哪儿敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00024",
      "start_ms": 42200,
      "end_ms": 44500,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00025",
      "start_ms": 44520,
      "end_ms": 46000,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00026",
      "start_ms": 46020,
      "end_ms": 47240,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00027",
      "start_ms": 49120,
      "end_ms": 49360,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00028",
      "start_ms": 49640,
      "end_ms": 50540,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00029",
      "start_ms": 50760,
      "end_ms": 52140,
      "text": "怎么到我这就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52280,
      "end_ms": 53280,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53460,
      "end_ms": 54520,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00032",
      "start_ms": 54680,
      "end_ms": 56860,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00033",
      "start_ms": 59300,
      "end_ms": 60755,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00034",
      "start_ms": 61150,
      "end_ms": 62315,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63100,
      "end_ms": 65210,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00036",
      "start_ms": 65430,
      "end_ms": 66905,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00037",
      "start_ms": 69850,
      "end_ms": 71155,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00038",
      "start_ms": 71740,
      "end_ms": 72655,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00039",
      "start_ms": 73860,
      "end_ms": 74320,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00040",
      "start_ms": 74320,
      "end_ms": 75295,
      "text": "才守得住秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00041",
      "start_ms": 75850,
      "end_ms": 78850,
      "text": "呵呵呵这个哈哈哈啊啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79580,
      "end_ms": 80735,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00043",
      "start_ms": 81210,
      "end_ms": 82575,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00044",
      "start_ms": 82910,
      "end_ms": 83950,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00045",
      "start_ms": 84070,
      "end_ms": 84710,
      "text": "花开过了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00046",
      "start_ms": 84710,
      "end_ms": 85525,
      "text": "就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00047",
      "start_ms": 85760,
      "end_ms": 87555,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00048",
      "start_ms": 88020,
      "end_ms": 89805,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00049",
      "start_ms": 90090,
      "end_ms": 91490,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00050",
      "start_ms": 91490,
      "end_ms": 92425,
      "text": "我还高一头呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00051",
      "start_ms": 92720,
      "end_ms": 96735,
      "text": "各高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00052",
      "start_ms": 97140,
      "end_ms": 98895,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00053",
      "start_ms": 99300,
      "end_ms": 101215,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00054",
      "start_ms": 102100,
      "end_ms": 104555,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00055",
      "start_ms": 104870,
      "end_ms": 106975,
      "text": "只能在e聘上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00056",
      "start_ms": 107350,
      "end_ms": 108205,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00057",
      "start_ms": 108450,
      "end_ms": 110645,
      "text": "来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00058",
      "start_ms": 111070,
      "end_ms": 112590,
      "text": "领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00059",
      "start_ms": 112750,
      "end_ms": 114590,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能坐的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00060",
      "start_ms": 114590,
      "end_ms": 116005,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00061",
      "start_ms": 116960,
      "end_ms": 117415,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00062",
      "start_ms": 118410,
      "end_ms": 119685,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00063",
      "start_ms": 120030,
      "end_ms": 121590,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00064",
      "start_ms": 121750,
      "end_ms": 122950,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00065",
      "start_ms": 123090,
      "end_ms": 124635,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00066",
      "start_ms": 128350,
      "end_ms": 130450,
      "text": "小图今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00067",
      "start_ms": 130630,
      "end_ms": 131050,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00068",
      "start_ms": 131210,
      "end_ms": 132570,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00069",
      "start_ms": 132570,
      "end_ms": 133390,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00070",
      "start_ms": 133630,
      "end_ms": 135470,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00071",
      "start_ms": 135470,
      "end_ms": 139130,
      "text": "不是来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00072",
      "start_ms": 139270,
      "end_ms": 140270,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00073",
      "start_ms": 140350,
      "end_ms": 141170,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00074",
      "start_ms": 141530,
      "end_ms": 141950,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00075",
      "start_ms": 142070,
      "end_ms": 142730,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00076",
      "start_ms": 142730,
      "end_ms": 143330,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00077",
      "start_ms": 143390,
      "end_ms": 144810,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00078",
      "start_ms": 144970,
      "end_ms": 146970,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00079",
      "start_ms": 148650,
      "end_ms": 149310,
      "text": "小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00080",
      "start_ms": 149610,
      "end_ms": 151270,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00081",
      "start_ms": 151710,
      "end_ms": 153370,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00082",
      "start_ms": 153370,
      "end_ms": 156130,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00083",
      "start_ms": 156130,
      "end_ms": 157385,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00084",
      "start_ms": 158630,
      "end_ms": 160170,
      "text": "小图最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00085",
      "start_ms": 160350,
      "end_ms": 162330,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00086",
      "start_ms": 162450,
      "end_ms": 163730,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00087",
      "start_ms": 163850,
      "end_ms": 164550,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00088",
      "start_ms": 164590,
      "end_ms": 165690,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00089",
      "start_ms": 165690,
      "end_ms": 169210,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯小图啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00090",
      "start_ms": 169450,
      "end_ms": 171130,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00091",
      "start_ms": 171290,
      "end_ms": 172330,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00092",
      "start_ms": 172490,
      "end_ms": 174649,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00093",
      "start_ms": 174850,
      "end_ms": 178590,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝那些会说话会来事的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00094",
      "start_ms": 178710,
      "end_ms": 179850,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00095",
      "start_ms": 179930,
      "end_ms": 180690,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00096",
      "start_ms": 180790,
      "end_ms": 181650,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00097",
      "start_ms": 181730,
      "end_ms": 182965,
      "text": "甚至闲惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00098",
      "start_ms": 183290,
      "end_ms": 185245,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00099",
      "start_ms": 185550,
      "end_ms": 187745,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00100",
      "start_ms": 188060,
      "end_ms": 189220,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00101",
      "start_ms": 189400,
      "end_ms": 190795,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00102",
      "start_ms": 191050,
      "end_ms": 193670,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00103",
      "start_ms": 193810,
      "end_ms": 195170,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00104",
      "start_ms": 195230,
      "end_ms": 196095,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00105",
      "start_ms": 196420,
      "end_ms": 196560,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00106",
      "start_ms": 196560,
      "end_ms": 198620,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00107",
      "start_ms": 198820,
      "end_ms": 199460,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00108",
      "start_ms": 199940,
      "end_ms": 200940,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00109",
      "start_ms": 201020,
      "end_ms": 202385,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00110",
      "start_ms": 202720,
      "end_ms": 204360,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00111",
      "start_ms": 204480,
      "end_ms": 206175,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00112",
      "start_ms": 206460,
      "end_ms": 207440,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00113",
      "start_ms": 207500,
      "end_ms": 210600,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00114",
      "start_ms": 210680,
      "end_ms": 211840,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00115",
      "start_ms": 212040,
      "end_ms": 213345,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00116",
      "start_ms": 213670,
      "end_ms": 215010,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00117",
      "start_ms": 215270,
      "end_ms": 216670,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00118",
      "start_ms": 216870,
      "end_ms": 218270,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00119",
      "start_ms": 218290,
      "end_ms": 220195,
      "text": "这个真是让我一解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00120",
      "start_ms": 220480,
      "end_ms": 221705,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00121",
      "start_ms": 222030,
      "end_ms": 224490,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00122",
      "start_ms": 224490,
      "end_ms": 225210,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00123",
      "start_ms": 225450,
      "end_ms": 228115,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00124",
      "start_ms": 228380,
      "end_ms": 229700,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00125",
      "start_ms": 230040,
      "end_ms": 231515,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00126",
      "start_ms": 231770,
      "end_ms": 234175,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00127",
      "start_ms": 234500,
      "end_ms": 235580,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00128",
      "start_ms": 235780,
      "end_ms": 238175,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_183328bf0ee8b458_s00129",
      "start_ms": 238590,
      "end_ms": 240245,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
